WEBVTT

00:01.190 --> 00:03.600
I'm so excited about going to Maho's villa.

00:03.600 --> 00:06.270
Summer Paradise

00:04.230 --> 00:06.270
Maho's already there, right?

00:06.570 --> 00:08.240
She said that since summer holidays start today,

00:08.240 --> 00:11.060
she'd go and prepare.

00:11.060 --> 00:15.590
I was hoping Maho-chan would pick another swimsuit for me.

00:15.590 --> 00:18.030
The last one she gave me is a bit tight.

00:18.710 --> 00:19.450
Already?

00:20.010 --> 00:22.610
Which one are you buying, Tomoka-chan?

00:22.610 --> 00:24.210
I wonder which one I should get...

00:24.940 --> 00:28.500
How about buying an outrageous one and seducing Hasegawa-san?

00:28.500 --> 00:30.130
Seduce him?!

00:30.490 --> 00:31.590
Oh~!

00:31.590 --> 00:33.530
Hina will get this one.

00:33.530 --> 00:35.800
I wonder if Onii-chan will praise me.

00:35.800 --> 00:38.680
Even so, that's way too outrageous!

00:38.680 --> 00:39.880
Oh?

00:39.880 --> 00:41.150
I see.

00:41.850 --> 00:45.350
Hey, forget about the seducing; which one of these two is better?

00:45.350 --> 00:47.810
I think this one looks...

00:48.690 --> 00:50.480
No means no, Nee-sama!

00:51.070 --> 00:52.210
Going to the sea...

00:52.210 --> 00:53.440
Kagetsu is against this!

00:53.890 --> 00:55.290
You're mean, Kage.

00:55.290 --> 00:57.870
You're always tying Hina down.

00:57.870 --> 00:59.720
That's not what I'm trying to do.

00:59.720 --> 01:00.790
I just...

01:01.150 --> 01:01.930
Bu~!

01:01.930 --> 01:03.200
Bully.

01:03.200 --> 01:04.960
I don't care about you anymore, Kage.

01:05.370 --> 01:06.000
Wai-

01:06.000 --> 01:08.460
Hold on, Nee-sama!

01:19.970 --> 01:23.310
Don't give up and do your best

01:23.310 --> 01:26.690
Try your luck and fight! Chin-up!

01:26.690 --> 01:29.730
I know perfectly

01:29.730 --> 01:33.400
How weak a person is on their own

01:33.610 --> 01:36.570
Things that are on the verge of being lost

01:36.570 --> 01:40.240
I hold them close to my chest

01:40.240 --> 01:43.200
Your gentle words

01:43.200 --> 01:47.160
Caress my cheeks

01:47.160 --> 01:50.210
The irritation that has been building up

01:50.210 --> 01:53.000
From wanting to reach the goal

01:53.000 --> 01:57.170
My heart that almost wants to burst out crying

01:57.170 --> 02:00.760
The place that warms it up

02:00.760 --> 02:03.680
Even if we have to go through the pain

02:03.680 --> 02:07.180
We have to protect this

02:07.180 --> 02:08.640
We're unripe fighters!

02:08.640 --> 02:10.560
We won't lose now

02:10.560 --> 02:13.940
We will raise our small hands up in the air

02:13.940 --> 02:17.360
Take in that vital power, embrace it

02:17.360 --> 02:20.820
Then release it towards the sky!

02:20.820 --> 02:22.370
The courage that cannot be stopped

02:22.370 --> 02:24.200
jump and shoot

02:22.370 --> 02:24.200
Tomorrow we'll jump and shoot!

02:24.200 --> 02:27.120
I will pass the ball to you

02:27.120 --> 02:31.420
The memories that are awoken by our calls

02:31.420 --> 02:34.960
Game

02:31.420 --> 02:34.960
Will move the game along

02:41.580 --> 02:44.930
Running Side-by-Side

02:41.580 --> 02:44.930
Towards Freedom

02:45.260 --> 02:46.910
Welco-maho!

02:46.910 --> 02:48.310
Thanks for coming, thanks for coming!

02:49.350 --> 02:51.150
We're here, we're here!

02:51.150 --> 02:55.730
Was it really okay to invite me to the villa, too?

02:56.090 --> 02:57.390
What are you saying?

02:57.390 --> 02:59.400
There's no point if Subarun doesn't come!

02:59.690 --> 03:00.970
That's right.

03:00.970 --> 03:03.650
You're always taking care of us, too.

03:03.650 --> 03:07.370
Thank you very much for taking the time to play with us.

03:07.370 --> 03:08.590
Oh~!

03:08.590 --> 03:10.750
Onii-chan, let's have lots of fun!

03:11.410 --> 03:12.780
Yeah.

03:12.780 --> 03:13.630
Thank you.

03:13.960 --> 03:16.200
Okay, then let's get changed and go swimming in the sea!

03:16.200 --> 03:17.550
This way, this way!

03:18.210 --> 03:21.370
Hina-chan, was Kage-chan okay with this?

03:21.370 --> 03:22.300
Oh~!

03:22.300 --> 03:24.350
She understood after I talked to her about it.

03:24.710 --> 03:27.010
Ge-tan tends to worry a lot.

03:27.010 --> 03:28.150
Bu~!

03:28.150 --> 03:30.000
Even though I can swim properly...

03:30.000 --> 03:31.590
She doesn't have club activities today either,

03:31.590 --> 03:33.560
so you should've brought her along.

03:33.560 --> 03:34.760
Oh~?

03:34.760 --> 03:36.980
Asking her to come would've been okay?

03:41.800 --> 03:43.040
Come in.

03:44.310 --> 03:45.200
Touko-sensei.

03:45.720 --> 03:47.310
My, Kagetsu-chan.

03:47.310 --> 03:47.990
What's the matter?

03:48.780 --> 03:50.830
Um, actually...

03:54.190 --> 03:56.210
Coming to the beach once in a while isn't too bad.

03:56.540 --> 03:59.340
Be thankful that I brought you along.

03:59.340 --> 04:01.880
In return, I'll get you to coach during the summer holidays, too.

04:01.890 --> 04:03.800
I know.

04:04.470 --> 04:05.340
But...

04:05.340 --> 04:07.510
Is there something you're worrying about?

04:07.930 --> 04:11.890
Up until now we've had clear goals,
like beating the boys' basketball club...

04:11.890 --> 04:14.250
...and winning the tournament.

04:14.250 --> 04:16.480
But I'll have to start thinking about how to do things from now on.

04:17.010 --> 04:19.610
Having a goal makes things simpler, after all.

04:19.610 --> 04:21.640
That's true...

04:21.640 --> 04:23.900
Subarun, sorry to keep you waiting!

04:26.300 --> 04:27.140
How is this?

04:27.140 --> 04:28.490
Does it look good?

04:28.490 --> 04:30.710
Oh, it's cute!

04:31.480 --> 04:32.540
It looks nice!

04:32.540 --> 04:34.960
Hasegawa-san, what about the rest of us?

04:35.920 --> 04:37.380
How is it?

04:40.390 --> 04:42.130
Everyone looks fabulous, of course!

04:42.500 --> 04:44.940
And last, but not least...

04:45.810 --> 04:46.930
Come on, Tomo!

04:47.730 --> 04:50.100
Um, I...

04:51.400 --> 04:52.560
It looks great on you.

04:54.030 --> 04:55.720
Thank you very much!

04:55.720 --> 04:57.300
Isn't that good, Tomoka-chan?

04:57.300 --> 04:59.040
You look good in it, Mo-kan!

04:59.040 --> 05:00.090
Oh~!

05:00.090 --> 05:02.220
Everyone chose it.

05:02.220 --> 05:03.570
But are those okay?

05:03.570 --> 05:05.750
They're fine!

05:05.750 --> 05:07.160
They're totally fine!

05:07.440 --> 05:11.330
You know what, Onii-chan? Tomoka <i>does</i> have breasts-

05:11.330 --> 05:12.980
It's nothing!

05:12.980 --> 05:15.840
All right, let's go swimming!

05:17.380 --> 05:18.680
Ah~!

05:18.120 --> 05:19.340
Hina, come here, come here!

05:26.240 --> 05:27.840
How was it, Hasegawa-san?

05:27.840 --> 05:29.680
That was amazing, Airi!

05:29.680 --> 05:31.140
Your crawl is perfect!

05:32.500 --> 05:35.440
It's all thanks to Hasegawa-san and Aoi-san!

05:35.440 --> 05:37.900
I would've liked to have shown Aoi-san, too.

05:38.270 --> 05:41.830
It's rare for her to catch a summer cold.

05:41.830 --> 05:43.900
Hey, Subarun!

05:43.900 --> 05:45.990
Let's play tag!

05:46.840 --> 05:49.320
Rock, Paper, Scissors!

05:49.320 --> 05:50.890
Oh~?

05:50.890 --> 05:51.950
Hina will be "it"!

05:51.950 --> 05:53.670
Run!

05:53.670 --> 05:55.150
One...

05:55.150 --> 05:56.480
...two...

05:56.480 --> 05:57.870
...three...

05:56.950 --> 06:00.420
If I ran too far, I'd feel sorry for her.

06:00.990 --> 06:02.420
...nine...

06:02.420 --> 06:03.480
...ten!

06:04.770 --> 06:05.920
Oh~!

06:05.920 --> 06:07.340
I'm coming!

06:07.900 --> 06:10.170
Wait, Onii-chan!

06:10.170 --> 06:11.550
Run!

06:11.550 --> 06:12.560
Come on, I'm here!

06:12.560 --> 06:13.600
Touch!

06:14.640 --> 06:15.890
You caught me.

06:16.390 --> 06:17.410
Bu~!

06:17.410 --> 06:19.690
Onii-chan, run away properly.

06:19.690 --> 06:20.960
Hey, Subarun!

06:20.960 --> 06:21.900
Do you really want to play?

06:22.200 --> 06:23.400
I'm sorry.

06:23.400 --> 06:24.780
I'll play seriously this time.

06:25.730 --> 06:28.020
Then how about the one who catches Hasegawa-kun...

06:28.020 --> 06:30.610
...can ask him to do anything they like?

06:30.610 --> 06:33.040
Anything they like?

06:33.040 --> 06:34.300
It's decided!

06:34.300 --> 06:35.910
We're all "it"!

06:36.750 --> 06:39.670
I'm coming, Onii-chan!

06:39.670 --> 06:41.830
There!

06:44.580 --> 06:46.620
Onii-chan, prepare yourself!

06:44.590 --> 06:46.620
I'm coming!

06:46.620 --> 06:47.260
There!

06:47.260 --> 06:48.670
Prepare yourself!

06:51.860 --> 06:54.430
Damn, Subarun's tough.

06:54.430 --> 06:56.640
He knows our formations well,

06:56.640 --> 06:59.350
so getting close to him won't be easy.

06:59.350 --> 07:01.430
We've got five people,

07:01.430 --> 07:04.060
so there must be a good strategy we can use...

07:04.060 --> 07:05.180
Young ladies.

07:05.180 --> 07:06.650
You seem to be in a little trouble.

07:08.340 --> 07:10.010
Just a small hint.

07:10.010 --> 07:14.070
Subaru's good at basketball, but he's average at everything else.

07:14.070 --> 07:15.480
For example,

07:15.480 --> 07:16.540
something like swimming.

07:17.650 --> 07:20.230
If we manage to stop Hasegawa-san's footwork...

07:20.230 --> 07:21.220
Oh~!

07:21.220 --> 07:23.470
Let's sneak up and catch him!

07:25.110 --> 07:28.230
So, they've finished their strategy meeting.

07:29.920 --> 07:30.910
Huh?

07:34.740 --> 07:36.430
Oh no!

07:37.990 --> 07:38.810
This is bad!

07:39.480 --> 07:42.310
Subaru-san, prepare yourself!

07:47.360 --> 07:49.490
Sorry!

07:49.490 --> 07:53.610
What are you doing, you lolicon bastard?

07:57.500 --> 07:59.750
A castle, a castle...

08:01.970 --> 08:03.280
Shall we tickle him?

08:03.280 --> 08:04.540
Agreed!

08:07.460 --> 08:09.670
Stop it!

08:10.210 --> 08:12.970
Tickle, tickle~!

08:12.140 --> 08:12.970
Stop it!

08:13.790 --> 08:15.390
Tomoka, save-

08:16.410 --> 08:17.760
Airi...!

08:19.650 --> 08:23.600
I never thought the two of you would do something like this!

08:24.370 --> 08:25.600
Everyone!

08:26.100 --> 08:29.110
It's about time we eat lunch!

08:29.110 --> 08:30.660
Yes!

08:35.640 --> 08:36.530
Oh~!

08:36.530 --> 08:37.660
It moved!

08:37.660 --> 08:41.200
Sea creatures sure are mysterious.

08:41.200 --> 08:44.220
Airin, how about choosing this for the research project?

08:44.220 --> 08:44.920
Oh~!

08:44.920 --> 08:45.710
Octopus-san!

08:48.270 --> 08:48.960
Airi?!

08:50.180 --> 08:52.910
It feels slimy and gross!

08:53.940 --> 08:55.090
Hey, Octopus!

08:55.090 --> 08:56.810
Let go of Airin!

08:56.810 --> 08:57.850
You...!

08:59.270 --> 09:00.890
My swimsuit!

09:04.410 --> 09:06.310
No!

09:11.770 --> 09:13.500
Delicious!

09:13.500 --> 09:15.630
It tastes great, right Airin?!

09:15.630 --> 09:17.760
It really does!

09:17.760 --> 09:19.410
Nee-sama!

09:21.530 --> 09:22.620
Kage?

09:23.500 --> 09:26.280
Let's go back together, Nee-sama!

09:31.490 --> 09:33.510
Oh, it's Ge-tan.

09:33.510 --> 09:34.840
Ge-tan?

09:34.840 --> 09:37.010
She's Hinata's younger sister, Kagetsu-chan.

09:37.010 --> 09:39.010
And on top of that, Touko's here too.

09:39.010 --> 09:39.910
Why?

09:39.910 --> 09:41.810
Quite a lot happened.

09:41.810 --> 09:43.140
Let's go back, Nee-sama.

09:43.660 --> 09:44.350
I don't want to.

09:44.750 --> 09:49.100
Geez, why don't you listen to anything I say?

09:49.100 --> 09:50.320
Bu~!

09:50.320 --> 09:52.270
You'll just tie Hina down.

09:52.680 --> 09:54.970
Anyway, Nee-sama, let's go home.

09:54.970 --> 09:55.860
I don't want to!

09:56.200 --> 09:57.420
I'm not going home.

09:57.420 --> 09:58.530
Nee-sama...

09:58.530 --> 10:02.490
Well, we came all the way out here to play, so how about joining us-

10:02.930 --> 10:04.660
You're Coach Hasegawa, right?

10:05.360 --> 10:06.290
Yes.

10:06.750 --> 10:08.440
When I heard that you were my sister's coach,

10:08.440 --> 10:11.020
I went ahead and looked up your background.

10:11.020 --> 10:13.580
You're a very dangerous person!

10:13.580 --> 10:15.460
A very dangerous person?

10:15.920 --> 10:17.930
You pretend to teach basketball,

10:17.930 --> 10:22.310
but there's no mistaking that you're using this chance to touch Nee-sama's body...

10:22.310 --> 10:24.890
...and look at her sweating with those beastly eyes!

10:25.850 --> 10:27.270
Kagetsu, you sure are one sharp girl.

10:27.270 --> 10:28.510
There's nothing sharp about those findings!

10:28.510 --> 10:30.810
My, there's no need to hide it.

10:30.810 --> 10:33.420
I really love children, too.

10:33.420 --> 10:34.250
Aren't you the same?

10:34.250 --> 10:35.860
I'm saying that's not right!

10:35.860 --> 10:41.690
Just as I thought, I can't leave Nee-sama with someone like you!

10:41.690 --> 10:42.780
Come, Nee-sama.

10:42.780 --> 10:43.990
Bu~!

10:43.990 --> 10:46.450
Kage, you're not allowed to bully Onii-chan!

10:47.440 --> 10:51.880
Onii-chan is very kind and is important to Hina!

10:52.330 --> 10:55.300
Even if it's you, Kage, if you bully Onii-chan, I won't forgive you!

10:59.420 --> 11:01.620
Onii-chan, I'm sorry.

11:01.620 --> 11:03.440
Nee-sama!

11:06.790 --> 11:07.950
Sorry.

11:07.950 --> 11:09.980
Anyway, do you want to eat lunch?

11:09.980 --> 11:11.540
That's right, Ge-tan.

11:11.540 --> 11:12.770
We'll talk then.

11:13.790 --> 11:15.110
Yes.

11:16.910 --> 11:18.860
Then, Kagetsu asked you, Touko?

11:19.130 --> 11:23.040
She suddenly came to the school infirmary and asked me to bring her to the beach.

11:23.040 --> 11:24.740
But, how did you find this place?

11:26.380 --> 11:29.080
Don't underestimate my Thousand Mi-loli Eyes.

11:26.380 --> 11:29.080
TL Note: "Sen-rorigan" is a pun on "Senrigan" from the Chinese classical novel
<i>Journey to the West</i>, which means "eyes which can see over a thousand miles".

11:31.010 --> 11:35.340
Kagetsu-chan was worried about Hinata-chan's trip and didn't have any other choice.

11:35.830 --> 11:38.290
Well, that sounds about right.

11:38.290 --> 11:39.170
Why?

11:39.760 --> 11:42.530
It's already been three years since then.

11:42.530 --> 11:47.580
On a very cold day in winter, Hinata-chan collapsed.

11:48.410 --> 11:51.020
That day, their parents were away working, while they stayed home.

11:51.380 --> 11:56.300
Kagetsu-chan was waiting for
Hinata-chan to come home from school,

11:57.390 --> 11:59.610
but she fell asleep.

12:01.530 --> 12:04.810
When Hinata-chan came home, she didn't realise.

12:06.960 --> 12:08.410
Oh~?

12:12.370 --> 12:16.880
She was waiting on the porch in the snow.

12:17.330 --> 12:19.290
And then, Hinata-chan...

12:23.480 --> 12:29.250
Kagetsu-chan called the school and rushed Hinata-chan to the hospital.

12:31.130 --> 12:34.020
Fortunately, she got away with only a fever.

12:35.100 --> 12:36.940
So that's what happened.

12:36.940 --> 12:40.280
I heard this when I became Hina's homeroom teacher.

12:40.780 --> 12:44.030
Kagetsu hit puberty before Hina.

12:44.490 --> 12:49.870
Hina doesn't really mind, but Kagetsu's always
worried about what happened three years ago.

12:50.330 --> 12:54.960
She seems to blame herself for Hina's weak body.

12:55.290 --> 12:59.840
That's also why she's so opposed to Hinata-chan playing basketball.

12:59.840 --> 13:02.210
She keeps worrying that Hina will faint again.

13:02.710 --> 13:06.640
But Hina is doing fine, and she's passionate about basketball.

13:09.700 --> 13:13.350
If this goes on, it won't be good for either of them.

13:14.010 --> 13:20.180
To repair their relationship, we have to take away Kagetsu's guilt.

13:23.190 --> 13:25.730
Everyone, it's a little sudden,

13:25.730 --> 13:28.660
but let's have some impromptu club activities now.

13:29.130 --> 13:32.330
I want Kagetsu-chan to know a bit more about us.

13:32.330 --> 13:33.290
Wha-

13:33.290 --> 13:35.180
Are you seriously going to hold club activities here?!

13:35.180 --> 13:39.570
Of course, if anyone feels tired, I'll stop the activities immediately.

13:39.570 --> 13:40.920
Is that okay, Hinata-chan?

13:40.920 --> 13:42.760
Oh~!

13:42.760 --> 13:45.300
Kage, Hina is strong!

13:45.300 --> 13:46.930
Nee-sama...

13:48.110 --> 13:49.680
I understand.

13:49.680 --> 13:51.400
Let's try our best, Kagetsu-chan!

13:51.400 --> 13:53.900
Our special training is really tough!

13:53.900 --> 13:54.990
That's fine.

13:54.990 --> 13:56.850
I have confidence in my stamina.

13:57.200 --> 13:58.820
Then, let's start.

13:58.820 --> 13:59.650
Yes!

14:03.820 --> 14:05.070
Get set...

14:05.070 --> 14:05.980
Start!

14:11.890 --> 14:12.810
Oh~!

14:12.810 --> 14:14.550
We ran.

14:14.550 --> 14:16.280
How was it, Kagetsu-chan?

14:16.280 --> 14:19.170
This isn't such a big deal for me.

14:19.620 --> 14:21.210
I figured as much.

14:21.210 --> 14:24.200
More importantly, Nee-sama is tired.

14:24.200 --> 14:25.730
Please let her rest.

14:25.730 --> 14:27.970
Did Hinata-chan say such a thing?

14:29.050 --> 14:30.600
How are you feeling, Hinata-chan?

14:30.600 --> 14:31.510
Oh~!

14:31.510 --> 14:32.870
I'm perfectly fine.

14:32.870 --> 14:33.760
I've still got a lot in me!

14:34.450 --> 14:37.570
A mini basketball tournament lasts for 24 minutes.

14:37.570 --> 14:39.310
She should be fine even after all this.

14:39.860 --> 14:43.360
But Nee-sama is holding it all in and not saying that she's tired-

14:43.360 --> 14:45.780
Hey, Kage, let's run a marathon.

14:46.850 --> 14:49.780
Hina wants to run with Kage.

14:50.190 --> 14:51.740
But...

14:52.560 --> 14:55.160
I want to run with you.

14:53.730 --> 14:54.250
with you~

14:56.580 --> 14:57.660
Yes.

14:58.270 --> 15:00.320
Hina, are you okay?

15:00.320 --> 15:00.940
Oh~!

15:00.940 --> 15:02.250
I feel great!

15:02.250 --> 15:03.590
I'll run with them, too.

15:04.040 --> 15:06.720
If Subaru-san is with them, we won't have to worry.

15:06.720 --> 15:10.550
But will she be able to beat Ge-tan?

15:10.550 --> 15:14.470
Kage-chan was first in last year's school marathon.

15:15.220 --> 15:17.390
I see.

15:21.120 --> 15:23.850
Now then, on your mark!

15:23.850 --> 15:27.940
Kage, if Hina wins this race, stop complaining.

15:29.080 --> 15:30.540
Okay.

15:30.540 --> 15:34.250
Then, if I win, please stop pushing yourself so hard.

15:35.080 --> 15:36.460
Get set...

15:36.460 --> 15:37.160
Start!

15:41.920 --> 15:43.460
Do your best, both of you!

15:49.010 --> 15:50.550
They're running, they're running!

15:51.090 --> 15:55.030
Children running with all their strength is such a lovely sight.

15:55.030 --> 15:56.850
Why don't you go run with them?

15:56.850 --> 15:58.660
My, that's mean.

15:58.660 --> 16:01.850
I do like children, but with Mihoshi-chan's children-

16:02.090 --> 16:03.280
Don't say it, you pervert.

16:03.280 --> 16:04.230
Say it again.

16:09.530 --> 16:12.400
Nee-sama is breathing so hard...

16:14.450 --> 16:16.070
Be serious, Kage.

16:18.080 --> 16:21.160
Hina wants to see Kage at full strength.

16:21.750 --> 16:23.140
It's okay.

16:23.140 --> 16:24.260
I won't lose.

16:24.260 --> 16:24.920
But...

16:25.330 --> 16:27.520
I understand why you're worrying,

16:27.520 --> 16:30.050
but it wouldn't be a serious competition otherwise, right?

16:31.230 --> 16:32.480
I understand.

16:32.480 --> 16:33.900
I'll run at my best.

16:34.590 --> 16:35.990
Oh~!

16:35.990 --> 16:37.970
Kage is running.

16:42.400 --> 16:45.400
Would it have been better if we ran with them?

16:45.400 --> 16:48.190
Hina-chan will definitely be okay!

16:49.040 --> 16:51.860
Saki, have you caught Ge-tan's habit of worrying?

16:51.860 --> 16:54.750
I believe in her, too!

16:56.210 --> 16:58.700
She'll definitely be okay.

17:09.850 --> 17:11.130
Hinata-chan...

17:11.600 --> 17:12.660
Do your best!

17:19.220 --> 17:21.090
Wait, Nee-sama!

17:21.090 --> 17:23.350
Kage, hurry!

17:31.500 --> 17:33.400
It'll be okay now.

17:42.770 --> 17:44.870
Kage, let's go out and play.

17:45.290 --> 17:46.560
We shouldn't, Nee-sama.

17:46.560 --> 17:49.110
It would be bad if something happened.

17:55.500 --> 17:56.960
You're mean, Kage.

17:56.960 --> 17:59.430
You're always tying Hina down.

17:59.880 --> 18:02.760
It wouldn't be a serious competition otherwise, right?

18:04.160 --> 18:05.420
I...

18:27.510 --> 18:28.460
They're here!

18:31.380 --> 18:33.230
Here, here!

18:31.950 --> 18:33.930
Hina, come on!

18:32.700 --> 18:34.800
Kage-chan, just a little more!

18:33.230 --> 18:34.800
Hina, you can do it!

18:34.800 --> 18:36.580
Almost there, Kage-chan!

18:48.180 --> 18:49.600
Go for it!

18:53.860 --> 18:56.110
Goal!

19:01.960 --> 19:03.030
Nee-sama...

19:03.750 --> 19:06.790
Hina had fun.

19:06.790 --> 19:10.090
I finally managed to run with Kage.

19:10.090 --> 19:11.360
Yes.

19:11.360 --> 19:14.340
Nee-sama, your last spurt was amazing.

19:14.790 --> 19:15.730
Oh~!

19:15.730 --> 19:17.380
I was praised by Kage.

19:19.370 --> 19:24.450
Even if I don't worry, Nee-sama, you'll be fine on your own.

19:24.450 --> 19:25.330
Oh~?

19:25.330 --> 19:27.350
Why on my own?

19:27.950 --> 19:29.730
I can't be on my own.

19:29.730 --> 19:31.390
It's better to be with everyone.

19:31.890 --> 19:32.690
With Maho,

19:33.080 --> 19:34.110
Tomoka,

19:34.490 --> 19:35.400
Saki,

19:35.840 --> 19:36.820
Airi,

19:37.220 --> 19:40.150
and with Kage. I don't want to be without any of you.

19:40.500 --> 19:42.280
Hina is happy.

19:42.280 --> 19:44.550
I used to be bad at running.

19:44.550 --> 19:49.140
I always thought that Kage never had fun while playing with me.

19:49.140 --> 19:51.740
I always felt so sorry for making you worry.

19:51.740 --> 19:52.670
That's...

19:54.210 --> 19:57.670
But now, Hina can run a lot.

19:57.670 --> 20:01.300
So, from now on, let's play a together a lot!

20:03.630 --> 20:04.630
Yes!

20:05.690 --> 20:06.730
All right!

20:06.730 --> 20:08.640
When we get back, we're all taking a bath!

20:08.640 --> 20:11.460
Maho-chan, your house's bath is a hot spring, right?

20:11.460 --> 20:12.510
Really?

20:12.510 --> 20:14.560
I'm looking forward to it.

20:12.510 --> 20:13.720
Um...

20:14.560 --> 20:16.910
I'm sorry for all that.

20:16.910 --> 20:19.320
No, don't worry about it.

20:19.320 --> 20:22.110
Please take care of my sister.

20:22.570 --> 20:24.730
It might sound strange coming from me,

20:24.730 --> 20:27.700
but don't blame yourself too much.

20:28.160 --> 20:30.130
If Kagetsu-chan felt troubled,

20:30.130 --> 20:32.040
Hinata-chan would feel troubled, too.

20:33.270 --> 20:34.800
Thank you very much.

20:34.800 --> 20:38.590
I think I'll be able to support Nee-sama a lot in the future.

20:39.030 --> 20:39.630
I see.

20:39.630 --> 20:42.350
Hinata, which part do you wash first when you get into the bath?

20:42.350 --> 20:43.630
My hair.

20:45.820 --> 20:48.640
Although it was tiring, that was really fun!

20:48.640 --> 20:49.860
Oh~!

20:49.860 --> 20:53.310
Kage said she would help me with my passing practice tomorrow.

20:53.680 --> 20:57.410
I was thinking I might be of some use to you, Nee-sama.

20:57.410 --> 21:00.880
Hinata and Kagetsu-chan are such wonderful sisters.

21:02.060 --> 21:03.290
I'm pretty jealous.

21:03.290 --> 21:04.530
That's...

21:04.930 --> 21:07.890
Anyway, today sure was an eventful day.

21:07.890 --> 21:09.060
That's right.

21:09.060 --> 21:11.450
Swimsuits fell off, and people were attacked by octopuses.

21:11.450 --> 21:14.710
Don't talk about that!

21:15.460 --> 21:17.390
Huh, Nee-sama?

21:18.290 --> 21:20.130
I wonder where she went.

21:20.130 --> 21:21.950
Gecko, gecko, gecko...

21:21.950 --> 21:23.970
Gecko-san~

21:25.370 --> 21:26.660
Oh~?

21:29.350 --> 21:33.430
Ah, having the bath to yourself is such a luxury.

21:34.760 --> 21:35.710
Oh~!

21:35.710 --> 21:36.600
Onii-chan!

21:36.940 --> 21:38.510
Hinata-chan!

21:38.510 --> 21:39.150
Why?!

21:39.560 --> 21:40.820
Here, it's a gecko!

21:40.820 --> 21:44.860
What are you doing, you lolicon?!

21:47.830 --> 21:49.660
Subaru-kun, you sure are daring.

21:49.940 --> 21:52.580
This is a misunderstanding...

21:52.940 --> 21:54.270
Oh~?

22:00.790 --> 22:03.340
I want to grow up quickly (Yes-!)

22:13.060 --> 22:14.390
Come on! Come on!

22:14.390 --> 22:17.140
If I'm small, if I stay small

22:17.140 --> 22:19.650
You say there's virtue in it.

22:19.650 --> 22:21.230
But that's a lie!

22:21.230 --> 22:22.320
You're just trying to console me, right?

22:22.610 --> 22:24.940
I want to grow up faster!

22:25.360 --> 22:28.030
Drink milk, drink soy milk

22:28.030 --> 22:30.740
You say that the shrimp there is good.

22:30.740 --> 22:32.120
Triple A

22:32.120 --> 22:33.990
I don't need any ratings

22:33.990 --> 22:36.000
I want to grow up faster!

22:36.000 --> 22:36.790
Dribble!

22:36.790 --> 22:37.460
Zig-zag

22:37.460 --> 22:38.120
Defence!

22:38.120 --> 22:39.000
Offence (Yep!)

22:39.000 --> 22:41.080
I want to shoot the ball

22:41.830 --> 22:49.130
I want to be praised soon... by you

22:49.680 --> 22:52.180
"Look here. Look here. It's going to end!"

22:52.180 --> 22:54.850
Jump shite! Jump shite!

22:52.180 --> 22:54.850
Jump! Jump!

22:55.140 --> 22:57.350
More and more and more

22:58.230 --> 23:03.060
When can I become an adult

23:03.060 --> 23:08.860
I'm growing! It's painful! The painful sores.

23:09.150 --> 23:13.660
However, I'll definitely show you that I can endure it

23:13.660 --> 23:20.870
Shake, Bounce, Touch, Aim for the goal!

23:21.250 --> 23:24.340
Ah! I want to grow up faster!

23:25.730 --> 23:30.510
I was convinced by Zono and Shouji to go to the training camp...

23:30.510 --> 23:33.910
It's not like I'm thinking about Subaru, or anything!

23:33.910 --> 23:36.100
I'm going for everyone's sake!

23:36.100 --> 23:37.520
It's different, okay?!

23:37.040 --> 23:40.020
The Tragedy of the Beautiful Star
